  "description": "A full-featured .NET library for interacting with NFS (Network File System) servers. Supports NFSv2, NFSv3, and NFSv4 protocols with AUTH_NONE, AUTH_SYS, and RPCSEC_GSS authentication. Handles all edge cases including large files, retries, connection failures, and concurrent access.",
